    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kandinhale</strong> is a story-driven short RPG game in which you'll have to escape from the clutches of <i>Kandinhale</i>, the\u00a0company that owns almost the entire consumable market in this\u00a0idyllic candy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3448010/extras/cee17108b8c011f2a2a108bb81c9a196.avif?t=1746689590\" width=800 height=442 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Estimated playtime:</strong> <i>30 minutes - 45 minutes</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Number of endings:</strong> <i>7</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Kandinhale's factory and discover its secrets!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Themes about death, blood, violence, implied\u00a0suicide, mention of substance use and prostitution, mild cursing, mild jumpscares, syringes\u00a0\u00a0and strong images.\u00a0</i></p>",
